er MODEL. The newest version of the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in ","type":"text"},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is compared with the event by what the two mean, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" compares a plan, not by their bytes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When nothing differs, the file returned is the committed one, byte for byte, however it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is formatted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When a difference is breaking (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference\/isBreaking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), the export throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/breakingChange(event:version:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": a payload the published schema accepts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"could fail the new one, which Iglu publishes only as a new MODEL, so raise the event’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"version.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When every difference is compatible (an optional or defaulted property added, a property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed, a constraint loosened), it is an ADDITION. For "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry\/server","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" the file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returned 